// boundary (Pitfall #15).
//
// CONTEXT D-21 — four modes (extended by ADR auth-mode-none, 2026-05-03):
//   - passthrough: read X-Upstream-Auth, forward to upstream, never persist.
//   - stored:      look up encrypted credential in TENANT_DEK_KV, decrypt
//                  with per-tenant DEK (AES-256-GCM via Web Crypto).
//   - oauth:       delegate to @cloudflare/workers-oauth-provider; Phase 6
//                  wires the actual Logto tenant.
